{:edb/db-before-t 1202 :edb/db-after-t 1203 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534515 50 #inst "2026-10-12T01:36:25.460Z" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186117557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186117558 13194139534515 17592186045417 false] [17592186117557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186117559 13194139534515 17592186045417 false] [17592186117557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186117560 13194139534515 17592186045417 false] [17592186117557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186117561 13194139534515 17592186045417 false] [17592186117557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186117562 13194139534515 17592186045417 false] [17592186117557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186423949 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186117557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186423953 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186117557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186423954 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186117557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186423956 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186117557 1075 #edb/ref 17592186423958 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186117557 1078 #edb/ref 17592186423958 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186119834 1038 #edb/ref 17592186423960 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186120233 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186120233 1071 "Find a Cartesian equation of the plane that passes through the point $P(0, 2, 1)$ and is perpendicular to the line\n$\\frac{x - 1}{-2} = \\frac{y - 3}{1} = \\frac{z}{5}$." 13194139534515 17592186045417 false] [17592186120233 1071 "Find a Cartesian equation of the plane that passes through the point $P(0,2,1)$ and is perpendicular to the line \n$\\frac{x-1}{-2}=\\frac{y-3}{1}=\\frac{z}{5}.$" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186120233 1074 "First, we note that the position vector of $P$ is $p=⟨0,2,1⟩.$ From the canonical equation, we find that the line is parallel to the vector $⟨-2,1,5⟩.$ So, the normal vector of the plane is \n\n$$\nn=⟨-2,1,5⟩.\n$$\n\nUsing the dot product, we can find the equation of the plane as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-2,1,5⟩ & =⟨0,2,1⟩\\cdot ⟨-2,1,5⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-2,1,5⟩ & =7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to obtain the Cartesian equation of the plane, we substitute $r=⟨x,y,z⟩$ into the equation above and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨-2,1,5⟩ & =7 \\\\ -2x+y+5z & =7 \\\\ -2x+y+5z-7 & =0 \\\\ 2x-y-5z+7 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423948 1043 #edb/ref 17592186423961 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423948 1043 #edb/ref 17592186423962 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423948 1043 #edb/ref 17592186423963 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423948 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423948 1045 "The Cartesian Equation of a Plane" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423948 1046 #edb/ref 17592186423962 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423948 1048 #edb/ref 17592186046658 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423948 1049 #edb/ref 17592186050830 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423948 1053 #uuid "2e339301-4273-5fe3-adcf-f9263b991a91" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423949 1080 "2x-y-5z+11=0" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423949 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423949 1083 #uuid "0395970e-0d9a-5762-bb5c-e46f2d38b8c0" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423950 1080 "(r-⟨0,0,0⟩)\\cdot ⟨3,-2,1⟩=0" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423950 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423950 1083 #uuid "13bd6234-56f6-541c-bfc5-f390a8cb5bfa" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423951 1080 "(r-⟨0,0,0⟩)\\cdot ⟨1,2,3⟩=0" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423951 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423951 1083 #uuid "1d1ce09d-4b43-5ecf-b718-dbc33ca70dc2" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423952 1080 "(r-⟨0,0,3⟩)\\cdot ⟨1,-2,3⟩=0" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423952 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423952 1083 #uuid "2c57426d-3447-5790-bc09-7f27391e4e89" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423953 1080 "x+3y-7=0" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423953 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423953 1083 #uuid "4b65c837-ece2-5b2d-a1d6-63cd8cc028b3" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423954 1080 "x+3y-1=0" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423954 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423954 1083 #uuid "5e5c8545-4573-5ed8-bdbb-b47cb8a05b58" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423955 1080 "(r-⟨0,0,0⟩)\\cdot ⟨1,-2,3⟩=0" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423955 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423955 1083 #uuid "95f99c20-a235-5660-8d6b-b04b727483d7" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423956 1080 "2y+z+7=0" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423956 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423956 1083 #uuid "a9e87eac-968b-5331-95b6-4aa94e8c328b" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423957 1080 "(r-⟨0,0,\\frac{1}{3}⟩)\\cdot ⟨1,-2,3⟩=0" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423957 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423957 1083 #uuid "b1292071-77e9-579a-8b2f-0a1e4da37f19" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423958 1080 "2x-y-5z+7=0" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423958 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423958 1083 #uuid "c2a52ec1-f084-5a8c-880c-5ed843166cc3" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423959 1075 #edb/ref 17592186423950 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423959 1075 #edb/ref 17592186423951 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423959 1075 #edb/ref 17592186423952 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423959 1075 #edb/ref 17592186423955 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423959 1075 #edb/ref 17592186423957 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423959 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423959 1077 "selection" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423959 1078 #edb/ref 17592186423955 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423959 1079 #uuid "0fa9de33-9d04-55cd-94a1-cecb483c4e8f" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423960 1068 #edb/ref 17592186423959 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423960 1069 "q-70819" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423960 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423960 1071 "Given the Cartesian equation $x-2y+3z=0$ of the plane $Π$, find an equation of $Π$ in the form $(r-p)\\cdot n=0.$" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423960 1072 #uuid "e005b4ab-002a-57d1-b9b7-3fc85eeb395f" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423960 1074 "First, from the equation of the plane we get that the normal vector of $Π$ is $n=⟨1,-2,3⟩.$\n\nNow, we solve the Cartesian equation of $Π$ for $z$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x-2y+3z & =0 \\\\ 3z & =-x+2y \\\\ z & =-\\frac{1}{3}x+\\frac{2}{3}y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we put, say, $x=0$ and $y=0$, we get $z=0.$ Hence, the point $P(0,0,0)$ lies on $Π.$ Note that the position vector of $P$ is $p=⟨0,0,0⟩.$\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ (r-⟨0,0,0⟩)\\cdot ⟨1,-2,3⟩ & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423961 1062 #uuid "24b7f863-ce6a-5264-b6ec-ac8e65ecdb05" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423961 1063 #edb/ref 17592186338833 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423962 1058 #edb/ref 17592186423963 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [17592186423962 1062 #uuid "3d11e9af-f90d-5fbe-a96b-a527fdd70135" 13194139534515 17592186045417 true] [175921864